/* Shared contact-page kit.
 *
 * The page's motion machinery — the running clock, the cursor-heated accent
 * word, the typed composer, the FAQ row — was written once for the default
 * layout and is worth more than one layout. It lives here so the variants in
 * ./variants can build on it instead of reimplementing it three times.
 *
 * Nothing in this file decides layout. Every piece is presentational and
 * carries its own `ct-*` classes from ContactComponent.css, so a variant gets
 * the existing visual language for free and only adds what it changes.
 */
